		<pubDate>Wed, 04 Jul 2012 19:15:37 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=930#comment-12235</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[I also remember that I mentioned a Jamiat Khas gathering, and she said, &quot;Retired people like me can&#039;t afford things like that, but you go and have fun! I&#039;m sure it will be wonderful!&quot;

I can&#039;t send her to one now, but I hope in the future we can check in with our elders, and find out if they would like to attend events and help them do so. Ya Salaam, Rabia, and I hope you will be with us in spirit this November.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I also remember that I mentioned a Jamiat Khas gathering, and she said, &#8220;Retired people like me can&#8217;t afford things like that, but you go and have fun! I&#8217;m sure it will be wonderful!&#8221;</p>
<p>I can&#8217;t send her to one now, but I hope in the future we can check in with our elders, and find out if they would like to attend events and help them do so. Ya Salaam, Rabia, and I hope you will be with us in spirit this November.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
